# --- 300 K 平衡（协议 v1.3：两半各自 NVT）-------------------------------------
# 全局 NVT 只约束总动能，无法消除体系内部已有的温度梯度（界面弛豫差异会造成
# 两半相差数十 K，且衰减远慢于生产段）。因此平衡段对 z<zmid / z>zmid 两半
# 各用一个 NVT 控温，强制均匀 300 K 初态，再进入 NEMD 生产段。
velocity all create 300.0 1001 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes
variable zmid equal 0.5*(zlo+zhi)
region halfL block INF INF INF INF -100000.0 ${zmid} units box
region halfL block INF INF INF INF -100000.0 0.911434499999999 units box
region halfR block INF INF INF INF ${zmid} 100000.0 units box
region halfR block INF INF INF INF 0.911434499999999 100000.0 units box
group halfL_g region halfL
2548 atoms in group halfL_g
group halfR_g region halfR
3584 atoms in group halfR_g
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal
fix eqL halfL_g nvt temp 300.0 700.0 0.1
fix eqR halfR_g nvt temp 300.0 700.0 0.1
run 15000
